<title>GERMANY: Buba revises down German Aug industry orders. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Buba revises down German Aug industry orders. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS	Aug 96	   Jul 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.1 (+0.6)    +0.9</p>
<p>(Corrects Aug and Jul Month-on-Month change from +0.9(+0.6) and +0.1 respectively.)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +3.9 (+4.4)    +0.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    99.3 (99.8)    99.2</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.2 (+0.6)    +1.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.4 (+4.8)    -0.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    97.9 (98.3)    97.7</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -3.7  (-3.6)   -5.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -5.0  (-4.9)  +19.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   133.5 (133.6)  138.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
